WEBVTT

12:31.033 --> 12:33.576
-lt's a board game! Repeat, Battleship!
-Whew!

12:33.661 --> 12:35.870
Hallelujah!

12:35.955 --> 12:37.831
-Yeah! All right!
-Hey, watch it!

12:37.915 --> 12:39.666
Sorry there, old spud head.

12:39.750 --> 12:43.503
Mission accomplished. Well done, men.
Pack it up. We're goin' home.

12:43.587 --> 12:45.922
So did I tell ya?
Nothin' to worry about.

12:46.007 --> 12:49.426
I knew you were right all along, Woody.
Never doubted ya for a second.

12:50.136 --> 12:51.803
Wait a minute. Oh!

12:51.887 --> 12:55.974
-What do we have here?
-Wait! Turn that thing back on!

12:56.058 --> 12:57.851
Come in, Mother Bird!
Come in, Mother Bird!

12:57.935 --> 13:00.645
Mom has pulled a surprise
present from the closet.
